cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CMIP7 Area Explorer & ESGF-NG Web Portal"
message: "If you use CMIP7 Area Explorer in your research, coursework, or workflows, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Camargo"
    given-names: "Marcelo G. P."
    affiliation: "Department of Atmospheric Sciences, Institute of Astronomy, Geophysics and Atmospheric Sciences, University of São Paulo (IAG/USP)"
    email: "marcelo.garcia.camargo@usp.br"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mgpcamargo/cmip7-area-explorer"
url: "https://mgpcamargo.github.io/cmip7-area-explorer/"
abstract: >-
  Open-source interactive cartographic web application and CLI utility to delimit
  geographic bounding boxes, diagnose eligible CMIP7 realms and branded variables
  (MIP-DRS7), query live ESGF-NG STAC catalogs, inspect NetCDF holdings, and
  generate reproducible regional subsetting scripts using intake-esgf, xarray, and CDO.
keywords:
  - CMIP7
  - ESGF-NG
  - STAC
  - climate-models
  - meteorology
  - xarray
  - intake-esgf
  - cartography
license: MIT
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24599748"
version: "1.2.1"
date-released: "2026-11-27"
